WEBVTT

00:00.360 --> 00:06.500
Imperial Father, your son has indeed been overly ambitious. I was foolish enough to believe I could match Eldest Brother.

00:07.000 --> 00:14.000
Yet every deed I undertook was solely to prove to Father that I am worthy of your pride!

00:14.500 --> 00:20.500
Raise your head... Zhen has watched you grow since infancy. Do you truly take Zhen for a blind fool?!
